  "body": "The GPG key ([F473DD4473365DE1](https://keyserver.ubuntu.com/pks/lookup?search=0xF473DD4473365DE1&op=index)) used to sign the Debian repository at https://packages.matrix.org has an expiry date of 2023-04-15. We'll need to do something about this well in advance.\r\n\r\nRelated: https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix.org/issues/973\r\n",
